# Plugin Moodle — regras duras

- Escrita: `require_login` + `require_capability` + `require_sesskey`
- External: `validate_parameters` + `validate_context` + `require_capability`
- SQL: placeholders; limite via `$DB->get_records_sql(..., $from, $limit)`
- HTTP: `new \curl()` + SSL
- Saída: `s()` / Mustache / `format_text`
- Catch: `\Throwable`
- UI admin: skill `moodle-admin-layout` (azul)
- CI GitHub: skill `moodle-plugin-ci` + template `CI/ci.yml`
- Nome do repo: `moodle-<tipo>_<nome>` — skill `moodle-plugin-github`
